{:edb/db-before-t 1996 :edb/db-after-t 1997 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535309 50 #inst "2026-10-08T21:45:42.781Z" 13194139535309 true] [17592186092281 1020 #edb/ref 17592186343056 13194139535309 true] [17592186092281 1020 #edb/ref 17592186343070 13194139535309 true] [17592186092281 1020 #edb/ref 17592186343077 13194139535309 true] [17592186092282 1020 #edb/ref 17592186343065 13194139535309 true] [17592186092282 1020 #edb/ref 17592186343084 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343057 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343059 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343061 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343063 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1089 "q-328350" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1100 "Expressed in **ascending order** in radians, the **exact solutions** to the equation  $3tan\\,(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-3\\sqrt{3}=0,$ for $0\\le x<2\\pi ,$ are\n\n${x}_{1}=$\n{{field-1}}$,\\,{x}_{2}=$\n{{field-2}}$,\\,{x}_{3}=$\n{{field-3}}$,\\,{x}_{4}=$\n{{field-4}}." 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1113 #uuid "2ccfedc3-8e1d-5dac-9606-34084cd890a2" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343056 1145 "First, we rearrange the equation as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\operatorname{tan}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-3\\sqrt{3} & =0 \\\\ 3\\operatorname{tan}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & =3\\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\operatorname{tan}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe will find the general solution to the equation, and then generate all of the solutions in the required domain.\n\nThe general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}=\\frac{\\pi }{3}+n\\pi .\n$$\n\nSolving the equation above for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}-\\frac{\\pi }{6}+n\\pi  \\\\ 2x & =\\frac{\\pi }{6}+n\\pi  \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\pi }{12}+\\frac{n\\pi }{2} \\\\ x & =\\frac{(6n+1)\\pi }{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe set $n=0,\\pm 1,\\pm 2,…,$ until we have generated all solutions in the domain $0\\le x<2\\pi .$\n\n- Setting $n=0$ gives $x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}$\n\n- Setting $n=1$ gives $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{12}$\n\n- Setting $n=2$ gives $x=\\frac{13\\pi }{12}$\n\n- Setting $n=3$ gives $x=\\frac{19\\pi }{12}$\n\nAll other values of $n$ generate solutions outside the domain $0\\le x<2\\pi .$ \n\nSo, in ascending order, the solutions are \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}=\\frac{\\pi }{12},\\,{x}_{2}=\\frac{7\\pi }{12},\\,{x}_{3}=\\frac{13\\pi }{12},\\,{x}_{4}=\\frac{19\\pi }{12}.\n$$" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343057 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343058 13194139535309 true] [17592186343057 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535309 true] [17592186343057 1041 "field-1" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343057 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343058 13194139535309 true] [17592186343057 1110 #uuid "190cb89e-aebf-5c8e-b23b-575fc6dd86fa" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343058 1034 "\\frac{\\pi}{12}" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343058 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535309 true] [17592186343058 1111 #uuid "a9afd5b5-4ca7-5dc7-831d-30f699365815" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343059 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343060 13194139535309 true] [17592186343059 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535309 true] [17592186343059 1041 "field-2" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343059 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343060 13194139535309 true] [17592186343059 1110 #uuid "06c51fb8-b2f0-519d-8688-cf5b5bd5ebb7" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343060 1034 "\\frac{7\\pi}{12}" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343060 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535309 true] [17592186343060 1111 #uuid "787cc3ad-32ad-5fce-bffc-0e8e8c889a13" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343062 13194139535309 true] [17592186343061 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535309 true] [17592186343061 1041 "field-3" 13194139535309 true] [17592186343061 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343062 13194139535309 true] [17592186343061 1110 #uuid "7ea2b303-c0b2-5bab-9afa-861157738687" 131941